    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <!-- TODO(release): add <iconUrl> once a raw icon URL exists in the repository. -->
    <tags>coworking office real-estate price-index cli open-data</tags>
    <summary>Flexible-office prices by city, and coworking search, from CoworkingView.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
`cwv` reads the public, keyless API of [CoworkingView](https://coworkingview.com).

* `cwv rates` and `cwv cities` print the **CoworkingView Price Index**: median,
  25th and 75th percentile prices for flex desks, fixed desks and private offices
  per month, day passes per day and meeting rooms per hour, city by city.
  The data is licensed CC BY 4.0; `cwv` prints the required attribution.
* `cwv spaces` and `cwv space` search the catalogue of coworking spaces,
  private offices, meeting rooms, event spaces and virtual offices.

Output as aligned tables, CSV or JSON. A single static binary (rustls, no OpenSSL).

Homepage: https://coworkingview.com
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/coworkingview/flex-office-data/blob/main/rust/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
